Hi guys,

I've modified the build system for qtbase so that everything is built out of
the source tree. This is apparently how one is supposed to perform the
equivalent of a 'distclean' in autotools (simply delete the build
directory). I would suggest checking out a fresh copy, so that everything is
clean and remains so. R CMD INSTALL --(pre)clean will now clean everything
out and build from scratch.

As a side note, it seems we have taken over / branched the kdebindings/smoke
stuff. This may or may not become a maintenance issue.

Michael
